# The Antique Collector (jeuno 25): the fame edge. A level 75 Warrior at Jeuno fame level 1 ((99 + 0 + 0) / 2 = 49):
# Imasuke's default 12; 100 (a GM; 50, level 2): 13.
lists PortJeuno/Imasuke/onTrigger
